{"id":"vod_sn_36930","vodId":"36930","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"Slow Start","name_cn":"Slow Start","date":"2018-01-01","year":"2018","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/0e3b6b67c8ec3f70eaf922d005c29785.jpg"},"summary":"一之濑花名（近藤玲奈 配音）刚刚从初中毕业，即将来到新的学校开始美好的高中生活。花名的个性有些内向害羞，因此十分担心自己在新的环境中是否能够顺利的交到朋友。离开了父母和熟悉的故乡，花名来到了名为“手鞠Heights”的公寓，在这里开始了独自一个人的独立生活。　　事实证明，花名的担忧是多余的，没过多久，她就结识了一帮新朋友——成熟稳重善解人意的十仓荣依子（岭内知美 配音）、我行我素大大咧咧的百地玉手（伊藤彩沙 配音）、娇小可爱沉默寡言，比花名还要怕生内向的千石冠（长绳麻理亚 配音），和新朋友们在一起，花名的快乐日常就此展开。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:47:20","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/ULspLepGB31/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/TVMTbkA11M1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/4gMqjFsP1u1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/QXRZi2xs7k1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/WUgfv1WpZB1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/f8kiFu84Ty1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/eJjiBtTGjT1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/UNsaweyvJr1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/XaPgPn6TvF1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/WgJ1neuQmf1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Mg2BDKLgEk1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/fJ8RKgA0LH1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:17.229Z"}